    {"type": "text", "id": "orch_text", "x": 655, "y": 235, "width": 490, "height": 170, "text": "ORCHESTRATION (core/)\n\nTNBCSimulacrum (agent.py)\n  主编排器，协调所有子系统\n\nEventBus (event_bus.py)\n  Pub/Sub解耦通信，40+事件类型\n\nStateSchema (state_schema.py)\n  tum_* / imm_* / crna_* 共170+状态键\n\nConfig (config.py)\n  12个dataclass配置类", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "orch", "originalText": "ORCHESTRATION (core/)\n\nTNBCSimulacrum (agent.py)\n  主编排器，协调所有子系统\n\nEventBus (event_bus.py)\n  Pub/Sub解耦通信，40+事件类型\n\nStateSchema (state_schema.py)\n  tum_* / imm_* / crna_* 共170+状态键\n\nConfig (config.py)\n  12个dataclass配置类", "autoResize": true},
