    {"type": "text", "id": "tme_text", "x": 485, "y": 755, "width": 390, "height": 290, "text": "[5] TME - TMEManager\n\nImmuneDynamics (immune_dynamics.py)\n  imm_cd8_count: CD8+ T细胞计数\n  imm_cd4_count: CD4+ T细胞计数\n  imm_nk_activity: NK细胞活性\n  imm_treg_ratio: Treg抑制比例\n\nImmuneEvasion (immune_evasion.py)\n  evs_pd_l1_level: PD-L1表达\n  evs_mhc_i_down: MHC-I下调\n\nImmunoediting (immunoediting.py)\n  ied_phase: 消除/平衡/逃逸\n\nFibroblast (fibroblast.py)\n  caf_activation: CAF激活状态\n  caf_ecm_density: ECM密度", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "tme", "originalText": "[5] TME - TMEManager\n\nImmuneDynamics (immune_dynamics.py)\n  imm_cd8_count: CD8+ T细胞计数\n  imm_cd4_count: CD4+ T细胞计数\n  imm_nk_activity: NK细胞活性\n  imm_treg_ratio: Treg抑制比例\n\nImmuneEvasion (immune_evasion.py)\n  evs_pd_l1_level: PD-L1表达\n  evs_mhc_i_down: MHC-I下调\n\nImmunoediting (immunoediting.py)\n  ied_phase: 消除/平衡/逃逸\n\nFibroblast (fibroblast.py)\n  caf_activation: CAF激活状态\n  caf_ecm_density: ECM密度", "autoResize": true},
