    {"type": "text", "id": "rx_text", "x": 915, "y": 755, "width": 390, "height": 290, "text": "[6] TREATMENT - TreatmentManager\n\nChemotherapy (chemo.py)\n  drg_chemo_conc: 药物浓度\n  drg_chemo_kill: 细胞杀伤率\n\nImmunotherapy (immuno.py)\n  drg_immuno_block: PD-1阻断率\n  drg_immuno_boost: 免疫增强\n\nTargeted (target.py)\n  drg_parp_inhibit: PARP抑制\n  drg_akt_inhibit: AKT抑制\n\nRadiotherapy (radio.py)\n  drg_radio_dose: 辐射剂量(Gy)\n\nCircRNATherapy* (circrna_rx.py)\n  drg_crna_delivered: circRNA剂量\n  drg_crna_expression: 蛋白表达", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "rx", "originalText": "[6] TREATMENT - TreatmentManager\n\nChemotherapy (chemo.py)\n  drg_chemo_conc: 药物浓度\n  drg_chemo_kill: 细胞杀伤率\n\nImmunotherapy (immuno.py)\n  drg_immuno_block: PD-1阻断率\n  drg_immuno_boost: 免疫增强\n\nTargeted (target.py)\n  drg_parp_inhibit: PARP抑制\n  drg_akt_inhibit: AKT抑制\n\nRadiotherapy (radio.py)\n  drg_radio_dose: 辐射剂量(Gy)\n\nCircRNATherapy* (circrna_rx.py)\n  drg_crna_delivered: circRNA剂量\n  drg_crna_expression: 蛋白表达", "autoResize": true},
