    {"type": "text", "id": "crna_text", "x": 1345, "y": 755, "width": 390, "height": 290, "text": "[7] CIRCRNA* - CircRNAManager\n\nImmuneSensing (immune_sensing.py)\n  crna_immuno_score: 免疫原性(0-1)\n  crna_rig_i_act: RIG-I激活\n  crna_tlr_signal: TLR信号\n\nStructurePred (structure_pred.py)\n  crna_structure_mfe: MFE能量\n  crna_bsj_stability: BSJ稳定性\n\nTorusFoldScorer (torusfold_scorer.py)\n  crna_torus_score: 结构评分\n  crna_confidence: 置信度\n\nCircRNAEvolution (cirrna_evo.py)\n  crna_evo_fitness: 进化适应度\n\nDrugResponse (drug_resp.py)\n  crna_drug_synergy: 药物协同", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "crna", "originalText": "[7] CIRCRNA* - CircRNAManager\n\nImmuneSensing (immune_sensing.py)\n  crna_immuno_score: 免疫原性(0-1)\n  crna_rig_i_act: RIG-I激活\n  crna_tlr_signal: TLR信号\n\nStructurePred (structure_pred.py)\n  crna_structure_mfe: MFE能量\n  crna_bsj_stability: BSJ稳定性\n\nTorusFoldScorer (torusfold_scorer.py)\n  crna_torus_score: 结构评分\n  crna_confidence: 置信度\n\nCircRNAEvolution (cirrna_evo.py)\n  crna_evo_fitness: 进化适应度\n\nDrugResponse (drug_resp.py)\n  crna_drug_synergy: 药物协同", "autoResize": true},
