    {"type": "text", "id": "torus_text", "x": 1345, "y": 1125, "width": 390, "height": 190, "text": "[8] TORUSFOLD DL (torusfold/)\n\n5种结构预测模式:\n\n  heuristic: 启发式快速推断(无GPU)\n  simple: MDS坐标降维\n  diffusion: AlphaFold3风格扩散模型\n  physics_b: 几何约束求解器\n  physics_ba: 几何约束+OpenMM精修\n\n输出:\n  3D坐标预测 + confidence置信度", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "torus", "originalText": "[8] TORUSFOLD DL (torusfold/)\n\n5种结构预测模式:\n\n  heuristic: 启发式快速推断(无GPU)\n  simple: MDS坐标降维\n  diffusion: AlphaFold3风格扩散模型\n  physics_b: 几何约束求解器\n  physics_ba: 几何约束+OpenMM精修\n\n输出:\n  3D坐标预测 + confidence置信度", "autoResize": true},
    {"type": "arrow", "id": "arr_crna_to_torus", "x": 1540, "y": 1050, "width": 0, "height": 70, "points": [[0,0],[0,70]], "strokeColor": "#ec4899", "strokeWidth": 2, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "boundElements": [{"id": "arr_torus_task", "type": "text"}]},
