    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "bio", "x": 50, "y": 1120, "width": 300, "height": 180, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "opacity": 35, "boundElements": [{"id": "bio_text", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "bio_text", "x": 55, "y": 1125, "width": 290, "height": 170, "text": "[9] BIOMARKER\n\nBiomarkerTracker\n  bio_pd_l1_cps: PD-L1 CPS评分\n  bio_til_density: TIL浸润密度\n\nSubtypeClassifier\n  bio_subtype: BLIS/IM/M/LAR\n\nResistanceDetector\n  bio_resistance_sig: 耐药签名", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "bio", "originalText": "[9] BIOMARKER\n\nBiomarkerTracker\n  bio_pd_l1_cps: PD-L1 CPS评分\n  bio_til_density: TIL浸润密度\n\nSubtypeClassifier\n  bio_subtype: BLIS/IM/M/LAR\n\nResistanceDetector\n  bio_resistance_sig: 耐药签名", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "clin", "x": 370, "y": 1120, "width": 300, "height": 180, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "opacity": 35, "boundElements": [{"id": "clin_text", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "clin_text", "x": 375, "y": 1125, "width": 290, "height": 170, "text": "[10] CLINICAL\n\nRECISTTracker\n  cli_recist_response: CR/PR/SD/PD\n  cli_tumor_change: 肿瘤变化率\n\nSurvivalModel\n  cli_pfs_months: 无进展生存期\n  cli_os_months: 总生存期\n\nToxicityGrader\n  cli_toxicity_grade: CTCAE分级", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "clin", "originalText": "[10] CLINICAL\n\nRECISTTracker\n  cli_recist_response: CR/PR/SD/PD\n  cli_tumor_change: 肿瘤变化率\n\nSurvivalModel\n  cli_pfs_months: 无进展生存期\n  cli_os_months: 总生存期\n\nToxicityGrader\n  cli_toxicity_grade: CTCAE分级", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "pk", "x": 690, "y": 1120, "width": 300, "height": 180, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "opacity": 35, "boundElements": [{"id": "pk_text", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "pk_text", "x": 695, "y": 1125, "width": 290, "height": 170, "text": "[11] PK/PD\n\nRNACTM (rnactm.py)\n  crna_pk_auc: AUC药效积分\n  crna_pk_half_life: 半衰期(h)\n  crna_pk_peak: 蛋白峰值\n  crna_pk_bioavail: 生物利用度\n\nBackend: rnactm | external", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "pk", "originalText": "[11] PK/PD\n\nRNACTM (rnactm.py)\n  crna_pk_auc: AUC药效积分\n  crna_pk_half_life: 半衰期(h)\n  crna_pk_peak: 蛋白峰值\n  crna_pk_bioavail: 生物利用度\n\nBackend: rnactm | external", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "enc", "x": 1010, "y": 1120, "width": 300, "height": 180, "backgroundColor": "#1a4d4d", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#06b6d4", "strokeWidth": 2, "opacity": 35, "boundElements": [{"id": "enc_text", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "enc_text", "x": 1015, "y": 1125, "width": 290, "height": 170, "text": "[13] ENCODER\n\nRNATransformer (model.py)\n  BERT-style RNA编码器\n\nTokenizer (tokenizer.py)\n  K-mer分词器\n\n用途: 为TorusFold等\n  提供预训练embedding", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "enc", "originalText": "[13] ENCODER\n\nRNATransformer (model.py)\n  BERT-style RNA编码器\n\nTokenizer (tokenizer.py)\n  K-mer分词器\n\n用途: 为TorusFold等\n  提供预训练embedding", "autoResize": true},

