    {"type": "text", "id": "exp_text", "x": 55, "y": 1365, "width": 590, "height": 170, "text": "[14] EXPERIMENTS (14个模板)\n\nexperiment_akt_pi3k.py: AKT通路抑制\nexperiment_parp_brca.py: PARP合成致死\nexperiment_circrna_therapy.py: circRNA治疗验证\nexperiment_subtype_comparison.py: 四亚型对比\nexperiment_combination_*.py: 联合治疗\nexperiment_resistance_evolution.py: 耐药演化\n+ 8个更多实验模板...", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "exp", "originalText": "[14] EXPERIMENTS (14个模板)\n\nexperiment_akt_pi3k.py: AKT通路抑制\nexperiment_parp_brca.py: PARP合成致死\nexperiment_circrna_therapy.py: circRNA治疗验证\nexperiment_subtype_comparison.py: 四亚型对比\nexperiment_combination_*.py: 联合治疗\nexperiment_resistance_evolution.py: 耐药演化\n+ 8个更多实验模板...", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "pages", "x": 680, "y": 1360, "width": 600, "height": 180, "backgroundColor": "#1e3a5f", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "strokeWidth": 2, "opacity": 35, "boundElements": [{"id": "pages_text", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "pages_text", "x": 685, "y": 1365, "width": 590, "height": 170, "text": "[15] STUDIO PAGES (6个Web界面)\n\n1_CircRNA_Analysis.py: 粘贴序列 -> 免疫原性评分\n2_Drug_Prediction.py: ADMET预测 -> 药物优化\n3_Epitope_Screening.py: MHC表位 -> 疫苗设计\n4_TNBC_Simulator.py: 数字孪生 -> 治疗模拟\n5_Report_Export.py: JSON/HTML报告生成\n6_Joint_Analysis.py: circRNA+Drug联合分析", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "pages", "originalText": "[15] STUDIO PAGES (6个Web界面)\n\n1_CircRNA_Analysis.py: 粘贴序列 -> 免疫原性评分\n2_Drug_Prediction.py: ADMET预测 -> 药物优化\n3_Epitope_Screening.py: MHC表位 -> 疫苗设计\n4_TNBC_Simulator.py: 数字孪生 -> 治疗模拟\n5_Report_Export.py: JSON/HTML报告生成\n6_Joint_Analysis.py: circRNA+Drug联合分析", "autoResize": true},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "ext", "x": 1310, "y": 1360, "width": 430, "height": 180, "backgroundColor": "#3a3a3a", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "strokeColor": "#a0a0a0", "strokeWidth": 2, "opacity": 35, "boundElements": [{"id": "ext_text", "type": "text"}]},
    {"type": "text", "id": "ext_text", "x": 1315, "y": 1365, "width": 420, "height": 170, "text": "[16] EXTERNAL (可插拔后端)\n\nViennaRNA: RNA二级结构(~150ms)\nESM-2: 蛋白语言模型(2-5s GPU)\nNetMHCpan: MHC结合预测(AUC=0.92)\nOpenMM: MD分子动力学(physics_ba)\n\n离线优先，按需切换高精度在线服务", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "strokeColor": "#e5e5e5", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": "ext", "originalText": "[16] EXTERNAL (可插拔后端)\n\nViennaRNA: RNA二级结构(~150ms)\nESM-2: 蛋白语言模型(2-5s GPU)\nNetMHCpan: MHC结合预测(AUC=0.92)\nOpenMM: MD分子动力学(physics_ba)\n\n离线优先，按需切换高精度在线服务", "autoResize": true},

